This plugin is a rebuild of the `skill-doctor` skill from
https://github.com/warpdotdev/common-skills
(.agents/skills/skill-doctor/ at commit f3b58c81d1cfd5d8eabf2e32edb32db2b0573923),
copyright Denver Technologies, Inc. The two scoring rubrics under
skills/skill-doctor/scorers/ are preserved verbatim from upstream; the
skill-improvement filing bar is preserved inside
references/skill_edit_governance.md. The three rebuilt command-line tools, the
aggregation gate, the references, the assets, the agent and the command are
modifications and additions by this repository, released under the same terms.
The numbered list in README.md under "Deviations from upstream" records what
changed.

